nc-economic-shop-description-generic = A finite-stock item supplied through Night City's damaged logistics network.
nc-economic-shop-description-budget-pistol = A cheap service pistol: common, repairable and adequate at street distances.
nc-economic-shop-description-viper-pistol = A compact automatic pistol for buyers willing to pay for a faster follow-up shot.
nc-economic-shop-description-pistol-magazine = A loaded standard pistol magazine. Ammunition is sold separately from the weapon.
nc-economic-shop-description-light-armor = Concealable light protection intended to improve survival, not turn flesh into a bullet sponge.
nc-economic-shop-description-everyday-clothing = Ordinary civilian clothing with no corporate access or hidden protection.
nc-economic-shop-description-flatpack = A compact furniture package. Apply a pulsing tool to deploy it at the chosen location.
nc-economic-shop-description-construction-stack = A ten-unit bundle of reclaimed construction material.
nc-economic-shop-description-trauma-analgesic = A measured NC trauma analgesic dose. It suppresses pain; it does not erase the wound.
nc-economic-shop-description-broad-antibiotic = A broad antibiotic dose for treating bacterial complications under the NC pharmacology model.
nc-economic-shop-description-oxygen-carrier = A synthetic oxygen carrier for severe respiratory and blood-loss emergencies.
nc-economic-shop-description-tourniquet = Emergency hemorrhage control for a limb. Prolonged application has consequences.
nc-economic-shop-description-splint = A field splint for stabilizing damaged bones before definitive treatment.
nc-economic-shop-description-vehicle-maimai = A tiny, inexpensive city car suited to narrow streets and scarce fuel.
nc-economic-shop-description-vehicle-galena = A practical compact utility car built to survive patched roads and patched repairs.
nc-economic-shop-description-vehicle-quartz = A light coupe with sharper handling and a much less forgiving price.
nc-economic-shop-description-vehicle-part = A physical replacement component for the NC vehicle assembly and workshop systems.
